{"id":27102,"date":"2025-09-03T06:30:39","date_gmt":"2025-09-03T13:30:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/?p=27102"},"modified":"2025-09-03T06:30:42","modified_gmt":"2025-09-03T13:30:42","slug":"pr-remotespark","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/pr-remotespark\/","title":{"rendered":"RemoteSpark Officially Certified on ARGO\u2122 Platform, Redefining the Future of the Digitally Connected Workforce"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"27102\" class=\"elementor elementor-27102\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-108251dc e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"108251dc\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f50b4e2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"f50b4e2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"535\" src=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/PR-Kognitiv-Spark-RemoteSpark-1024x535.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-27105\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/PR-Kognitiv-Spark-RemoteSpark-1024x535.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/PR-Kognitiv-Spark-RemoteSpark-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/PR-Kognitiv-Spark-RemoteSpark-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/PR-Kognitiv-Spark-RemoteSpark-1536x803.png 1536w, https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/PR-Kognitiv-Spark-RemoteSpark-2048x1071.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4f048d5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"4f048d5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h3 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">RemoteSpark Officially Certified on ARGO\u2122 Platform, Redefining the Future of the Digitally Connected Workforce<\/h3>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-06892ce elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"06892ce\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Now available through DigiSaaS, Kognitiv Spark\u2019s RemoteSpark will empower teams wherever they are, helping organizations lead with agility, sustainability, and digital resilience. <\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-344ed80 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"344ed80\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-43e63a0 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"43e63a0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>Sunnyvale, CA \u2013 September 4, 2025:<\/strong>\u00a0DigiLens Inc., a leading nanotechnology innovator in waveguide display technologies and XR (extended reality) smartglasses, announces that RemoteSpark by Kognitiv Spark, a member of\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/digisaas\/\">DigiSaaS<\/a>, is officially ARGO-certified, marking a key milestone in its continued deployment on DigiLens ARGO\u2122. Built with end-users in mind,\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.kognitivspark.com\/remotespark-cloud\">RemoteSpark<\/a>\u00a0is the leading connected worker support platform for\u00a0the industrial and defense sectors, streamlining workflows, fostering seamless collaboration, and boosting productivity while reducing downtime and improving operational efficiency. Optimized for ARGO, the solution is designed for effortless implementation, regardless of the organization\u2019s level of experience in deploying heads-up display technologies. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>ARGO + RemoteSpark: Delivering a Future-Ready Solution<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.digilens.com\/argo\/\">ARGO<\/a>\u00a0and RemoteSpark\u2019s purpose-built capabilities can operate in demanding environments at a high level of precision and durability. Through the ARGO platform, RemoteSpark can deliver a reliable, robust, low-bandwidth solution, equipping modern workforces with the best tools to drive confidence, efficiency, and resilience on the frontline. Features include:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Seamless integration with\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.kognitivspark.com\/blog\/remotespark-2-5-brings-microsoft-teams-and-onedrive-to-the-field\">Microsoft<\/a> Teams and OneDrive: Provides flexible connectivity options and allows organizations to utilize tools they already have<\/li>\n<li>Real-time remote support and collaboration: ARGO\u2019s Crystal waveguide display and sensors provide a high-resolution experience to all, ensuring the job gets executed right the first time<\/li>\n<li>Simple hands-free information access: Keep important information directly in your field of view with RemoteSpark\u2019s built-in PDF viewer, supported by ARGO\u2019s spatial sensors<\/li>\n<li>High-resolution asset capturing and sharing: ARGO\u2019s 48MP center camera can capture critical details, while remote experts can add live photo annotations, enhancing remote diagnostics and feedback<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Industrial-grade AR is Not Just a Fad \u2013 It\u2019s Here to Stay.\u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u201cThe DigiLens and Kognitiv Spark partnership is more than just compatibility\u2013it\u2019s a shared vision. When organizations can get early results like reduced downtime and higher quality of work from their workforce, AR transitions from a novelty to a necessity,\u201d said Brian Hamilton, DigiLens VP of Sales and Marketing. \u201cClear first use ROI is the tipping point for AR adoption, and Kognitiv Spark is leading the way.\u201d<\/p>\n<p>The solution is already deployed with several customers, including the\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/posts\/kognitivspark_our-team-is-on-the-ground-in-aldershot-this-activity-7300918839431561216-cBQT?utm_source=share&amp;utm_medium=member_desktop&amp;rcm=ACoAAAWpzcgBaMbUbyGBLCcujeGuS1oWQyBAAsc\">UK Ministry of Defense<\/a>, with a focus on enhancing situational awareness, real-time decision-making, and operational effectiveness.<\/p>\n<p>\u201cTruly transformational technology can create an impact while almost fading in the background,\u201d said Yan Simard, CEO of Kognitiv Spark. \u201cRemoteSpark on the ARGO creates that seamless experience field workers are looking for, while generating near immediate, tangible benefits.\u201d<\/p>\n<p>Through DigiSaaS, DigiLens is creating an ecosystem of solutions designed to not only meet organizational needs where they are now, but more importantly, where they\u2019re going. With Kognitiv Spark, ARGO can deliver multi-level, sustainable impact to organizations by alleviating core issues, such as improved knowledge transfer, reduced equipment downtime, and lower travel costs. By combining ARGO, the first rugged, purpose-built, all-in-one AR and AI smartglasses, with solutions like RemoteSpark, workforces can achieve more and operate with confidence, solving issues quickly, safely, and accurately.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>To experience RemoteSpark on ARGO, schedule a live demo during DSEI 2025 in London, September 9-12, by contacting\u00a0\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/adam-clay-74bb1a6\/\">Adam Clay<\/a> (<a href=\"mailto:adam@kognitivspark.com\">adam@kognitivspark.com<\/a>), or contact DigiLens at <a href=\"mailto:engage@digilens.com\">engage@digilens.com<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d1f94f1 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"d1f94f1\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-f5383d8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"f5383d8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h5 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">###<\/h5>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3f9e6b9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"3f9e6b9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-533cca1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"533cca1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\" eplus-wrapper\"><b>About DigiLens Inc.<br \/><\/b><span style=\"font-style: inherit; font-weight: inherit;\">DigiLens is a leader in holographic waveguides used for XR displays. The company has developed a patented optical platform and photopolymer technology that deliver best-in-class solutions using a unique, low-cost contact-copy manufacturing process. DigiLens enables OEM partners to design and build XR-enabled devices for the global automobile, enterprise, consumer, avionics, and defense industries. Based in Sunnyvale, CA, DigiLens\u2019 investors include industry leaders like Samsung Electronics, Samsung Electro-Mechanics, Diamond Edge Ventures, the strategic investment arm of Mitsubishi Chemical Holdings Corporation, Alsop Louie Partners, Optimas Capital Management, 37 Interactive Entertainment, UDC Ventures, the corporate venture arm of Universal Display Corporation, Niantic, Inc., Sony Innovation Fund, Dolby Family Ventures, Continental AG, and more. <\/span>For more information, visit <a href=\"http:\/\/www.digilens.com\">www.digilens.com<\/a><\/p><p class=\" eplus-wrapper\"><em>Press Contact<\/em><br \/>Brian Hamilton<br \/><a href=\"mailto:brian.hamilton@DigiLens.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Brian.Hamilton@DigiLens.com<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b36c28a e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b36c28a\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4dfa788 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"4dfa788\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>About Kognitiv Spark<br \/><\/strong>Established in 2016, Kognitiv Spark is a global tech company recognized for its competency in the secure, reliable, and network-agnostic applications of AR and MR in commercial and government environments.<\/p>\n<p>Its flagship product, RemoteSpark\u2122, is a hands-free connected worker support solution designed specifically for commercial and government use. It empowers your team by enabling low-bandwidth, secure video and audio calls with remote experts, providing real-time guidance and assistance at the point of need. Additionally, RemoteSpark provides workers with instant access to critical information and documents directly through smart glasses and mobile devices. Users can independently retrieve the resources they need to complete tasks efficiently and accurately.<\/p>\n<p>Kognitiv Spark\u2019s mission is to help workforces achieve more, operate with confidence, and solve issues quickly, safely, and accurately, the first time, every time. They support a global footprint of clients and partners operating in manufacturing, defence, marine, energy, and multiple other industrial sectors.<\/p>\n<p>For more information visit <a href=\"http:\/\/www.kognitivspark.com\/\">www.kognitivspark.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><em>Press Contact<br \/><\/em>Ryley Anthony<br \/><a href=\"mailto:ryley@kognitivspark.com\">ryley@kognitivspark.com<\/a><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Kognitiv Spark\u2019s RemoteSpark will empower teams wherever they are, helping organizations lead with agility, sustainability, and digital resilience. <\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":27105,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_coblocks_attr":"","_coblocks_dimensions":"","_coblocks_responsive_height":"","_coblocks_accordion_ie_support":"","content-type":"","_uag_custom_page_level_css":"","editor_plus_copied_stylings":"{}","site-sidebar-layout":"default","site-content-layout":"","ast-site-content-layout":"default","site-content-style":"default","site-sidebar-style":"default","ast-global-header-display":"","ast-banner-title-visibility":"","ast-main-header-display":"","ast-hfb-above-header-display":"","ast-hfb-below-header-display":"","ast-hfb-mobile-header-display":"","site-post-tit